# Phase 5 transcript research: an answer with an ordered list of twelve items,
# a list that starts at 9 (so 9/10/11 differ in width), inline code in prose,
# in list items and in a bullet, a nested bullet and a code block. Inline
# code's colour is the change (5e32bce2: 245 -> 255 dark); ordered-number
# alignment (641f3f45) is post-v0.0.16, so old and new should agree there.
# Ctrl-O shows the same answer in the full transcript, with its header time.
gateway p5-transcript-md-turns.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
wait 4
type show me the list
wait 1
key Enter
wait 12
snap answered
snapfull answered
key C-o
wait 2
snap full
key PPage
wait 1
snap full-pgup
key C-o
wait 1
snap closed
gwlog
